<title>UK: Credit Suisse sets call warrants on dollar/yen.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse sets call warrants on dollar/yen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse Zurich says it has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on U.S. dollar/yen exchange rate.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 01.OCT.96-31.JUL.97   PAYDATE	30.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  USD/JPY 109.85</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	  ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  105.00 JPY    5.85 SFR     0.30 PCT     21.20 X</p>
<p> CALL B	  112.00 JPY    1.95 SFR     3.53 PCT     63.57 X</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
